    "description": "This dataset contains water temperature, salinity - surface water, microbial abundance, and others taken by CTD and water samples. As a part of the Malaspina circumnavigation cruise, the BIO Hesperides crossed US waters around Hawaii. CTD casts were used to obtain water for measurements of microbial abundance and nutrients and chlorophyll data. Data for three stations around Hawaii (one unclear whether is at the border of the territorial waters). This dataset is U.S. State Department MSR U2011-009 as part of the World Data Service for Oceanography. Data are in XLS and TEXT formats. Cruise report is in MsWord DOCX format.",
